 nazionale-di-spettacoli-brevi/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_m
 edium=referral
LOCATION:Sala Teatrale Palazzo di Città\, Sassari\, Sardinia\, Italy (6-8 
 May 2027). Open to Italian and international companies and artists.
